      "writtenOn": "2026-11-20T02:32:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The requirement includes both. Users need to be notified when a crashdump has been generated, and the notification should include the corresponding Entry ID. They can then use a common Redfish interface, such as the Attachment interface, to retrieve the crashdump using that Entry ID.",
